## 5. State machine — {{Document/Task lifecycle}}

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NEW
    NEW --> DOWNLOADING
    DOWNLOADING --> DOWNLOADED: 2xx
    DOWNLOADING --> FAILED: 5xx/timeout
    DOWNLOADED --> PARSED
    DOWNLOADED --> FAILED: parsing error
    PARSED --> SAVED
    PARSED --> FAILED: SP error
    SAVED --> DONE
    FAILED --> RETRY: do limitu
    RETRY --> DOWNLOADING
    FAILED --> DEAD: limit překročen
    DONE --> [*]
    DEAD --> [*]
```

## 6. Mapování chyb na stavy

| Chyba | Detekce | Cílový stav | Akce |
|---|---|---|---|
| HTTP timeout | `TaskCanceledException` | `RETRY` (do max 3) → `DEAD` | Log, čekej `2^n s`, zkus znovu |
| HTTP 5xx | response.StatusCode | `RETRY` | Stejně jako timeout |
| HTTP 4xx | response.StatusCode | `FAILED` (final) | Log do `task_errors`, status `FAILED` |
| Parsing error | `XmlException` / `HtmlException` | `FAILED` | Uložit raw payload do `documents_failed`, log |
| SP deadlock (1205) | `SqlException.Number == 1205` | `RETRY` (1×) | Counter retry +1 |
| FK violation (547) | `SqlException.Number == 547` | `FAILED` | Investigovat reference, jiný subjekt? |

